    "sourceHash": "c69790a1182b9b69995d9117d0e1efbe607f34ed5d10b66b538075acb4baaef5",
    "scene": "My child has paint on their hands, so I offer to wash them off first.",
    "translation": "I’ll wash the paint off the child’s hands first."
