    "sourceHash": "b5b5e94c5e80a06301b62253580ffce1d8c0e49a6014e69a17a91d648ea25fdf",
    "scene": "A friend says they are done watching television, and the speaker offers to switch it off.",
    "translation": "If you're done watching, I'll turn off the TV."
