    "sourceHash": "9599865ab3a15f1a3089d90691b7c56c6bf06f475d0f3f41882bfb65924d4d81",
    "scene": "Your friend forgot a ticket, and you decide to give Kenta the extra one.",
    "translation": "I'll pass the extra ticket to Kenta."
