    "sourceHash": "980d4c9813834b709f2b8f01c8abd3b0ce0a404432958e5de249b95d65df7fdc",
    "scene": "A companion is still packing while someone else heads across the bridge.",
    "translation": "I'll wait on the other bank, so I'll go ahead and cross the bridge."
