    "sourceHash": "826aede5165344f4083abcfcbc62e1a4c6d60cc409034251c89e7cd309f1fe58",
    "scene": "I reassure a friend who thinks the trip is long that we will reach the station as we chat.",
    "translation": "As we keep talking, we will be at the station before we know it."
