    "sourceHash": "f90fad5a314c0808a0b46a1945de2b3fb10b2149f55b92394a460d43bd3ece83",
    "scene": "A friend is about to look at the last page, where the culprit is revealed.",
    "translation": "If you look at the last page, you'll find out who the culprit is."
