    "id": "usage:chau:verb:終わる:おわる",
    "sourceHash": "5298a50e262e50931934d3f34f599b5a7a8149a6434eea7c8a2645c868c089d0",
    "scene": "My friend is still chatting, so I warn them that the movie will be over if we keep talking.",
    "translation": "If we keep talking like this, the movie will be over."
