    "sourceHash": "1a3154d7f813a1e1f5f627ae1dd1da59d6287f0db6bc3eebf832fedc974a6080",
    "scene": "A friend is about to leave without knowing the truth, so you decide to tell them.",
    "translation": "I can't keep hiding it, so I'll tell you the truth."
