    "id": "usage:chau:verb:起こす:おこす",
    "sourceHash": "7cbaea7c64eefa99d13a27d9b055cad924240749e2c2e99f0b202717d36c2c44",
    "scene": "Your friend has overslept, and it's time to leave, so you decide to wake him.",
    "translation": "It's time to go, so I'll wake him up."
