    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:始める:はじめる",
    "sourceHash": "7666244dc31865d2b9c210b537786c7071fe5622c182991e33a8965711d21527",
    "scene": "Your friend thinks it is too late to learn well as an adult, so you encourage him to study piano.",
    "translation": "Even if you start learning piano as an adult, you can still improve."
