    "sourceHash": "2a992da97982472d8539f225657e51091a7b64cbba5518ce0bffd5a686b002c8",
    "scene": "She tells a friend that the friendship will continue despite everyone else’s opinion.",
    "translation": "Even if everyone hates that person, I still want to be friends with them."
