    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:役立つ:やくだつ",
    "sourceHash": "6da72aaf9ea8fb73003ab0fe499c2b3728e82d6c01bf50743926507788d75350",
    "scene": "A friend recommends a useful tool, but it is beyond your budget.",
    "translation": "Even if this tool would be useful for work, it's too expensive for me to buy."
