    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:待つ:まつ",
    "sourceHash": "7fe3579f2e1ee1bef8d52cf6d4aa7624639d24c620d2b45913bf8c99da94039a",
    "scene": "The shop is closed today, so you urge your friend waiting outside to leave.",
    "translation": "No matter how long you wait here, the shop won’t open today."
