    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:忘れる:わすれる",
    "sourceHash": "a9984dfac533f7e2ac87f9d57d3cdc808b1ce1e89782db5f0a71089f9a39cc71",
    "scene": "A student worries that forgetting a line will anger the teacher.",
    "translation": "Even if you forget your lines, the teacher will not get mad."
