    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:思う:おもう",
    "sourceHash": "1a9a289d1062d0a8ffbf023aeb61f500ff40ba8cbddb69a056cc89e199b1ac7e",
    "scene": "A nervous friend is encouraged to keep their head up while on stage.",
    "translation": "Even if you feel embarrassed, let us keep our heads up on stage."
