    "sourceHash": "c6858573a026867273830a4989b4997ebbe04710196c733d36df8e9b6f204e25",
    "scene": "You forgot something at home, but there is still time to go back for it before meeting the group.",
    "translation": "Even if you go back home to get what you forgot, you'll still make it to the meetup on time."
