    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:打つ:うつ",
    "sourceHash": "8048cb7ac25025d2602c523d8f937b5ab72fdf244c8d7a275c1d1c0ead1b79d0",
    "scene": "A hard hit does not guarantee a home run.",
    "translation": "Even if you hit the ball hard, it does not guarantee a home run."
