    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:曲がる:まがる",
    "sourceHash": "9a2033443669e4bca4ba552d3a0545cbaad68cbc5b4ed1006bf3e36ec36e2812",
    "scene": "A friend hopes a turn at the next corner will get them past the roadworks.",
    "translation": "Even if you turn right at the next corner, you can't get through because of the roadworks."
