    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:来る:くる",
    "sourceHash": "465343fc1a83d478b39d98cd400fd88a08464facf0bfb309e5aa2c1dc0bd185e",
    "scene": "A guard is stationed at the entrance to an event.",
    "translation": "Whoever comes, the guard checks their ID first."
