    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:楽しむ:たのしむ",
    "sourceHash": "eb20e055e1137377480bf742114401a9b82447c26e1799c1a07427ea7ef696e2",
    "scene": "You and a friend are talking about how a trip can still make you long for home.",
    "translation": "No matter how much I enjoy the trip, I end up wanting to go home by the final day."
