    "sourceHash": "f81dd162add8654fec024703e5b4c531e483903774309762719bd71d809a1114",
    "scene": "A friend assumes singing with the group will keep you from getting nervous onstage.",
    "translation": "Even if I sing with everyone, I'll still get nervous onstage."
