    "sourceHash": "14575c6a15d7c578093cd82053cdffa1966b6cee1853a049f0238f2c9394a09b",
    "scene": "A friend expects the engine to cool off as soon as it is switched off.",
    "translation": "Even if you turn off the engine, it won't cool down right away."
