    "sourceHash": "3f5a3c913c0da5d5ec27b8a1ac7c33b9a665e508e50ebdc2a671d712a3ecddee",
    "scene": "A friend hopes a long walk will bring a change of scenery.",
    "translation": "Even if you walk a long way, the scenery won't change."
