    "sourceHash": "b9a9efeae76fe4d3dc7e9df093dd1516986f43f3919596296e240a75622ced2b",
    "scene": "A teammate is reassured about the game’s revival rule.",
    "translation": "Even if a character dies in this game, they will come right back to life."
