    "sourceHash": "4c97b2e518f6d468c5bdad152d0d9f4079951e86ac04ae4605a369cac6da5d64",
    "scene": "Your friend chose a date on his own, but you remind him the others need to coordinate too.",
    "translation": "Even if you choose the date on your own, that doesn’t mean everyone can come."
