    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:泣く:なく",
    "sourceHash": "15e30ec213f26837dbef1f4d5fcd6f7823b4dcc36a1cb71f8c44f4c6ed7fe0ac",
    "scene": "A child cries for a toy, but their father will not buy it.",
    "translation": "Even if you cry, Dad won't buy you the toy."
