    "sourceHash": "b32294ed7ec1b504a8fc42c563ec1c19b1e94288e41af205266ad3a7bee42553",
    "scene": "Tea poured into the cracked cup drains straight through the bottom.",
    "translation": "Even if you pour tea into that cup, it will leak out through the bottom."
