    "sourceHash": "379e78c1f5f229150f38e48afea9b6be3757d224de095bb178849efbc8fcc285",
    "scene": "A friend worries that swimming for an hour will leave you exhausted.",
    "translation": "Even after swimming for an hour, I still have the energy to keep swimming."
