    "sourceHash": "6cc43f2adc4fbb5ec261ebfe443d2b096c2f48c257c4992c92be9bcfae9b9341",
    "scene": "A friend hopes water alone will remove the paint, but it will not.",
    "translation": "Even if you wash it with water alone, this paint will not come off."
