    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:消す:けす",
    "sourceHash": "df65ed7a637510e063a5069cc5ec818edb7cdb326861a26e29576edf28cd766c",
    "scene": "Deleting the pictures from the phone will not remove their backup.",
    "translation": "Even if you delete the photos from your phone, the backup will still be there."
