    "id": "usage:tatte:verb:渡す:わたす",
    "sourceHash": "ce852d40ef68d8cac2042d5a7471d5f77e6a104c5639441cc0d2af875750629f",
    "scene": "You are explaining that handing over the paperwork is only one step in the process.",
    "translation": "Even if you hand the documents to the person, the procedure still won't be finished."
