    "sourceHash": "c1ee94e224c4db136cd4bade4966588c3f8a471698aa375fbdd0a90e974e53c3",
    "scene": "A friend is describing someone who stayed calm while crossing a swaying bridge.",
    "translation": "Even after crossing a swaying bridge, he looks completely unfazed."
