    "sourceHash": "fb8f3f51192ca76b66862e7cf5bec3084aa5a171852441509de3bfaf7294243d",
    "scene": "The meat is seared on the outside but still raw inside.",
    "translation": "Even if you only sear the outside, the inside will not be cooked through."
