    "sourceHash": "345c100234e6a8bdd1c6cefb6298c61e6e0eade26b6a9251ccb4723ef3da5629",
    "scene": "He complains to a friend that the child keeps messing up the room.",
    "translation": "Even after I tidy the room, the child immediately makes a mess again."
