    "sourceHash": "68962d521610088377bd79ac80288d4d08c5fc48f67e97ef0ed7835748d9c8b4",
    "scene": "Your friend envies the children of celebrities, but you say their future still depends on them.",
    "translation": "Even if you’re born into a famous actor’s family, that doesn’t mean you’ll become an actor."
