    "sourceHash": "7b7e6919e813b26e768d8940b799bc38b6f45d1c8ab15914c6ab4d7da9c0055e",
    "scene": "You feel uneasy at home and tell your roommate how you feel.",
    "translation": "Even when I tell them I feel anxious, my roommate won’t stay home with me."
