    "sourceHash": "e2ce1877f92c5969f63d3f39258f9aacc4543bf6b959f49137e31daa1a96f9e7",
    "scene": "I want my younger sister to ride the Ferris wheel with me, but she refuses even when I ask.",
    "translation": "Even when I ask, my younger sister won't ride the Ferris wheel with me."
