    "sourceHash": "6718799cdf8f31074f52e8dcc0708681018213114580ebb2a2aa56da46a12b30",
    "scene": "I want to look outside, but the balcony is dark.",
    "translation": "Even though I asked, my younger brother will not turn on the balcony light for me."
