    "id": "usage:tekureruNegative:verb:休む:やすむ",
    "sourceHash": "7249ee1830e8d63582aa56febeb3e6b1a0f7cc54cf3174312e9afe4ed6923d51",
    "scene": "Your mother keeps busy with housework and won't take even a short break despite your urging.",
    "translation": "No matter how many times I ask, Mom won't even take a short break."
