    "id": "usage:tekureruNegative:verb:住む:すむ",
    "sourceHash": "4ea6fa21998a1ef7ff4c70f600258ce95aa14dec6b1d677c758847f3bd37ff68",
    "scene": "I want my older sister to move in and help share the caregiving, but she won't.",
    "translation": "Even when I ask, my older sister won't live with me."
