    "sourceHash": "97121c9d547d177d861266b7ad793245b460dc0bd35ad3934bf7682db0e4e4d7",
    "scene": "I have explained my side of things to my older sister several times.",
    "translation": "No matter how many times I explain, my older sister will not believe me.",
    "note": "The older sister does not believe the speaker's own explanation; the speaker is the beneficiary marked by くれる."
