    "sourceHash": "6c82c6a7caf8561a10de87ee0bc023ddcce830c0b53800497da1fe8839fc11f8",
    "scene": "You need a car for the trip, and your older brother has been reluctant to help.",
    "translation": "Even when I ask, my older brother won’t go and borrow a car for me."
