    "id": "usage:tekureruNegative:verb:書く:かく",
    "sourceHash": "073ea368c49018df1b17891a7773e617e6a23b4bac3acc5233557f4fbdc770d6",
    "scene": "Even when I ask, my older brother won’t write down how to read the kanji.",
    "translation": "Even when I ask, my older brother won’t write down the kanji’s reading for me."
