    "id": "usage:tekureruNegative:verb:歌う:うたう",
    "sourceHash": "b62b0e1b7024c79f7eb3c9e7d08aae3089e5b8a1217289dfbbd88675e06bb24a",
    "scene": "I wanted to hear a song my older brother sings well, but he always turns me down.",
    "translation": "Even when I ask, my older brother won’t sing one of the songs he sings well for me."
