    "sourceHash": "ecfa97b7f149ca46bbd6a794f44cfdf0d2f3549afe34567729bf93e04eaaa4d8",
    "scene": "I need some quiet while my younger brother plays a game.",
    "translation": "I want some quiet, but my younger brother will not turn off the game sound for me."
