    "sourceHash": "2cfd449e4732ec0971293b968495d9d6bb79cbc7fe1d39bf4af6e00933142c13",
    "scene": "Everyone needs a plan, and your colleague has not made a decision.",
    "translation": "Everyone is waiting, but he won’t make the plans for me."
