    "sourceHash": "97d54f516be115b4d7f754f46d65ad38c961ff73e278591b5790f014fffb77f0",
    "scene": "You asked a friend to act out a crying scene, but they won't cry in front of the camera.",
    "translation": "My friend won't cry for me in front of the camera."
