    "sourceHash": "97888d325f2dece7fd901a51253ed23ecdb6de27f4fd4fa5d9946188bb6baeea",
    "scene": "You recall how the team defeated strong opponents on its way to the final.",
    "translation": "This team made it to the final after beating strong opponents along the way."
