    "sourceHash": "66d1e141cccd540660dbd4f144dfaa218b200a7063767d05f2f9bd8f28a0c700",
    "scene": "Boxes have started accumulating in your living room.",
    "translation": "The boxes keep piling up, and I’m starting to run out of places to put them."
