    "sourceHash": "146ba526ad13b1845103a2d28715cd084c3728390d913b1d581bfa2bd0fb05e0",
    "scene": "Spring is beginning to show across the region.",
    "translation": "Recently, spring festivals have begun in different parts of the country."
