    "sourceHash": "cb504eb278a7bc6237e3ea8bbbe080877752c406ff6029438182016107f9e185",
    "scene": "The chair is too low for the child to reach the table.",
    "translation": "Even sitting in this chair, the child cannot reach the tabletop."
